review_text:
ENG;
The game doesn't really have a main official server; control is entirely in servers run by groups of individuals. These servers attract large crowds of players to their own servers, where the admins, acting with bias, can instantly and permanently ban you from the game. You can't even access the Discord servers or contact higher-ups. The community is unprofessional and terrible, with you having to suffer the whims of a few children. It's a waste of your money. Definitely don't buy this game. Don't pay it any mind.
TR;
oyunun gerçek anlamda main bir resmi sunucusu mevcut değil,kontrol tamamen şahısların açmış olduğu belli gruplaşmaların bulunduğu sunucularda.Bu sunucular da oyuncu kitlelerini kendi sunucularına çekip,orada adminlerin taraflı davranışlarıyla birlikte seni anında oyundan kalıcı olarak yasaklayabiliyorlar,ne discord sunucularına girebiliyorsun ne de üst yetkililere ulaşabiliyorsun,profesyonellikten uzak ve bir kaç çocuğun kaprisini çekmek zorunda kaldığın berbat bir topluluğu var paranıza yazık kesinlikle bu oyunu almayın. Aldırmayın.

good idea but the only server with people on just kind of run around in one spot all together and pvp eachother, so you have this big hectic gathering of all species just jumping around, no real survival element unfortunately otherwise it might be more fun
{edit} 
server is pretty fun now but game is a broken buggy mess so review remains negative

Game is super buggy and laggy atm makes it super annoying and almost unplayable theres also alot of rubber banding and eating issues game has became like training my patience not to punch the monitor so if the issues get fixed maybe it will get better?....right? ;-;

Edit: Soo yeah its even worse. The game just crashed 7 times just trying to play the game so its literally unplayable, lots of fps drops, rubberbanding sooo yeah dont buy this.
P.S They charge you 150$ just for some skins, and like 90% of the models and animations aren't even theirs.
